segments.text:
We (and our
Service Providers
or
Advertising Partners
) may collect information using
Cookies and Similar Technologies
about:
the device, operating system, and browser you use, such as when browse our websites, access our apps, or open electronic communications from us;
the IP Address and related information (such as domain information, your internet provider and general geographic location);
browsing history on our website or in our apps (such as what you search for, the pages you view, how long you stay, and how often you come back);
how you search for our website, from which websites you arrive, and which of our
Business Partners’
websites you visit;
which ads or online content from us and our
Business Partners
you view, access, or click on;
your browsing and app use activities over time, and across websites and apps (
Service Providers
or
Advertising Partners
perform such activities on our behalf);
the likely associations among different browsers and devices, such as whether two devices are associated with the same individual;
whether you open our electronic communications and which parts you click on;
and information about your wireless account and device, including the location of your mobile device (for example, when you use mobile websites or apps to register to receive location-based content).
We (and our
Service Providers
or
Advertising Partners
) may also collect information made available through third-party platforms and apps (such as online social media platforms), through online databases or directories, or that is otherwise legitimately obtained. This information may be governed by the privacy notice(s) provided by the third party at the time of collection.
See the “
What are your choices
?” section below to learn more about your choices regarding the collection and use of your information, including through
Cookies and Similar Technologies
.
How do we use the information we collect about you?
We
(or our
Service Providers
who may be assisting us or acting on our behalf) may use
Online Information
we collect about you on its own or combine it with
Other Information
to:
Deliver and improve our products, services, and systems, including to:
recognize you when you return to our websites or use our apps across multiple devices;
complete transactions, including at retail stores and through digital channels (such as websites, apps, digital wallets, etc.);
tell you about updates to your accounts, products, and services;
update you about new features and benefits;
answer questions and respond to your requests made through our websites, through third-party websites (including social media), and through our customer contact channels;
use the location of your mobile device for location-based services that you may request;
determine how to best provide services to you and manage your accounts, such as the best way and time to contact you;
advertise and market our products and services – and those of our
Business Partners
– including to:
present content or ads online that are tailored to your interests, including
Targeted Advertising
, across multiple devices;
send or provide you with ads, promotions, and offers;
analyze whether our ads, promotions, and offers are effective;
help us determine whether you may be interested in new products or services;
provide location-based content and advertising personalization;
conduct research and analysis, including to:
better understand our customers across all of our communication channels, including our customer contact centers, our websites and apps;
allow you to give feedback by rating and reviewing our products and services and those of our
Business Partners
;
produce data analytics, statistical research, and reports;
assess, review and change our products, services, and systems;
manage fraud and security risk, including to:
detect and prevent fraud, criminal activity, or violations to our terms and conditions.
